title: The <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> joins the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>
subtitle: Staal consolidates further.
view-if: chancellor = "Staal" and (unionist_in_gov or in_staal_majority_coalition) and unionist_in_gov_time >= 10 and ((unionist_leader == "Bracht" and not unionist_gnu and bracht_time >= 8) or republicans_staal >= 8 and unionist_leader == "Sedgewick" or republicans_staal >= 10) and gnu_formed
new-page: true
priority: 1
tags: event
max-visits: 1

= <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> joins the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>

The end is near.

- @schleicher_2: The <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span> welcomes its newest member.

@schleicher_2
on-arrival: {!
Q.unionist_gnu = 1;

Q.pro_republic -= Q.unionist_votes;

Q.unionist_relation = (Q.gnu_relation - 10);

Q.gnu_r += Q.unionist_r;
Q.unionist_r = 0;
Q.bvp_r = 0;
!}

Current composition of the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span>:

[? if gnu_formed: - <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> ?]

[? if dstp_gnu: - <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> ?]

[? if lvp_gnu: - <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span> ?]

[? if unionist_gnu: - <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> ?]

[? if unionist_gnu: - <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span> ?]

[? if gold_gnu: - <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> ?]

[? if other_gnu: - **Others** ?]

